;
; How Broadsheet files an annotation in MYRA (broadsheet_rules.h BR4): its
; number in the document's notes file, the page it is on, where on the page
; (points from the page's lower left corner, across and up), its kind and
; when it was made (ms since 1970). MYRA holds the digits only; note.eve
; holds the kinds and the ranges.
^ZXBROAD(note:i4) = page:i6! ^ x:i5! ^ y:i5! ^ kind:i1! ^ stamp:i15!
